{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cozy world where you play as an Ooble Gardener. Tend to your giant garden pot and care for playful Oobles by crafting their dream fairy garden. Using offerings they give you, farming and fishing to discover an endless variety of cozy furniture to decorate the garden with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Meet Oobles!</strong> whimsical spirits that reside in the garden pot, dreaming visions of their ideal fairy garden that you can help create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/6bba1df14271d95147244e43524e1bae.poster.avif?t=1765264340\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/6bba1df14271d95147244e43524e1bae.webm?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/6bba1df14271d95147244e43524e1bae.mp4?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f Merge, combine and discover</strong> countless cozy furniture combinations using the offerings Oobles give you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/22e35b3400acfefc54e183b0c1372cb5.poster.avif?t=1765264340\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/22e35b3400acfefc54e183b0c1372cb5.webm?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/22e35b3400acfefc54e183b0c1372cb5.mp4?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf43 Decorate your garden pot</strong> with the cozy furniture you discover and create your dream fairy garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/0832a1891b6ac1ab186a5246a5f6e430.poster.avif?t=1765264340\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/0832a1891b6ac1ab186a5246a5f6e430.webm?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/0832a1891b6ac1ab186a5246a5f6e430.mp4?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd5 Complete the journal</strong> by discovering all of the possible combinations of varying categories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/c08991b286a56718fce871df9da8f76e.poster.avif?t=1765264340\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/c08991b286a56718fce871df9da8f76e.webm?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949790/extras/c08991b286a56718fce871df9da8f76e.mp4?t=1765264340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Grow and gather</strong> by planting Ooble offerings that sprout into